#
# Construct family: complementOf.
# Bad ⊑ A and Bad ⊑ ¬A (complementOf A), so Bad is provably empty (UNSATISFIABLE).
# No individual -> CONSISTENT ontology with one unsatisfiable class.
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdf:  <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix ex:   <https://gmeow.example/dl/complement#> .

ex: a owl:Ontology .

ex:A a owl:Class .
ex:NotA a owl:Class ;
  owl:complementOf ex:A .

ex:Bad a owl:Class ;
  rdfs:subClassOf ex:A , ex:NotA .
